+    """K7, between two steps (execute_model entry): every SFP_TICK steps one blocking read of the kernel's sticky
+    error word (4 int32) and, in an audit boot, of the 5 audit counters; one record to the residency telemetry file
+    and, less often, one server-log line. The error cannot be undone from here: it is logged, loudly."""
+    import torch
